    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideally located C. 93 M² 3 Bedroom & 2 Bathroom family home with attached Garage & generously sized surrounding gardens.  Located in a small mature development of 42 homes,  just north & within walking distance of Gorey’s Main Street."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "GROUND FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALLWAY   (1.773M x 4.243M)\t\t\t\r\nWith stairs to first floor and under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nSITTING ROOM   (3.626M x 4.247M)\r\nLocated to the front of the property with brick/timber fireplace housing a Stanley solid fuel stove.  Double doors leading through the dining area.  \r\nWall lighting either side of the fireplace.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM   (6.403M x 3.182M) \t\t\r\nWith fully fitted kitchen with integrated electric hob and oven, extractor hood.  Tiled splash backs. Sliding doors leading out to rear garden.\r\n\r\nUTILITY AREA   (1.680M x 1.332M)\r\nPlumbed for washing machine and door through to rear garden.\r\n\r\nSHOWER ROOM   (1.824M x 1.853M)\r\nWith white suite, wc and whb.  Built in shower unit (Triton T90i).  Fully tiled shower room.\r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR ACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nLANDING   (1.041M x 1.205M)\r\nLocation of hot press and attic access.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM ROOM   (2.207M x 2.017M)\t \t\t\t\r\nWith fully tiled walls and floor and white suite, wc, sink and bath. \r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1   (3.177M x 3.2M)\t\t\t\t\r\nLocated to the rear of the property with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 2   (3.022M x 3.376M) + (0.966M x 2.554M) \t\t\t\t\r\nLocated to the front with carpet flooring and extensive built in wardrobes with integrated dressing table.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3   (2.369M x 2.357M) \t\t\t\t\r\nLocated to the front with carpet flooring.\r\n\r\nATTACHED GARAGE  (2.6M X 4.5M)\r\n\r\nGARDENS\r\nFront garden in lawn with off street parking and block wall boundaries.  Gated side entrance.\r\nGenerously sized side and rear gardens in lawn with block wall boundaries.\r\n\r\nSERVICES\r\nESB, Water & Sewerage – general mains supply. \r\nExternal Windows & Doors – Hardwood double glazed throughout.\r\nHeating System – Plumbed for OFCH (new burner required),  and Solid Fuel Stove in Sitting Room.\r\nBER – C   (BER Number: 119873941)\r\n\r\nGENERAL\r\nThis ideal family home is located in a small well established development, which is located just off the Fort Road  C. 300 meters from Gorey Town’s busy Main Street.  Ard Laois is within easy walking distance of a wide range of amenities and facilities such as schools, creches, shops, restaurants, pubs, major supermarkets as well as bus and rail links. The property requires a little TLC, this property is brimming with potential and is awaiting a new lease of life.  The property is set on the end of row of houses with generously sized surrounding gardens."
      },
